---

<section class="hero section" id="top">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="section-label">
      <span aria-hidden="true">✦</span> For pop-up sellers & small retail teams
    </p>
    <h1>
      Track profit,
      <span>not just sales.</span>
      <em aria-hidden="true">↗</em>
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-lede">Know if a booth is worth renting again.</p>
    <p class="hero-body">
      MINIROS helps you run every selling shift: sales, payments, inventory,
      staff costs, rent, transport, deductions, and closeout, so you can see the
      real profit or loss of every location.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button button-primary" href="#early-access">
        <span>Join early access</span>
        <small>Limited slots</small>
      </a>
      <a class="button button-secondary" href="#how-it-works">
        <span>See how it works</span>
        <span class="button-icon" aria-hidden="true">▶</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-pills" aria-label="MINIROS product signals">
      <span>⚡ Mobile-first</span>
      <span>📡 Works offline</span>
      <span>🔄 Real-time sync</span>
      <span>🔒 Private by design</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <aside class="hero-proof" aria-label="MINIROS profit summary preview">
    <div class="profit-orb" aria-hidden="true">₱</div>
    <article class="profit-bubble bubble-main">
      <span>Rent-again verdict</span>
      <strong>Worth it</strong>
      <p>Shift profit stayed positive after rent, staff, transport, and deductions.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="profit-bubble bubble-small bubble-left">
      <span>Net profit</span>
      <strong>₱5,200</strong>
    </article>
    <article class="profit-bubble bubble-small bubble-right">
      <span>Closeout</span>
      <strong>Clean</strong>
    </article>
  </aside>
</section>
